.nh
.TH "LAGO" "1" "Sep 2026" "Lago CLI" "Lago CLI Manual"

.SH NAME
lago-v2-credit-notes-list - List credit notes


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBlago v2 credit-notes list [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Returns a cursor-paginated list ordered by creation time, newest first. Use after or before to navigate. The page and per_page parameters are rejected.
Lists finalized credit notes of the organization, including credit notes for legacy invoices. This list does not support created_at_from or created_at_to.
Requires the product catalog to be enabled and credit_note read permission on the API key.
Unknown values for credit_status, refund_status, reason and types[] are ignored rather than rejected. If no supported values remain for a filter, that filter is not applied.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--after\fP=""
	Opaque next_cursor from a previous response. Returns the next page. Cannot be combined with before or include_total_count=true. Keep the same filters when paging.

.PP
\fB--all\fP[=false]
	Fetch every page by following next_cursor

.PP
\fB--amount-from\fP=""
	Amount from.

.PP
\fB--amount-to\fP=""
	Amount to.

.PP
\fB--before\fP=""
	Opaque prev_cursor from a previous response. Returns the previous page in the same list order. Cannot be combined with after or include_total_count=true. Keep the same filters when paging.

.PP
\fB--billing-entity-codes\fP=""
	Billing entity codes[].

.PP
\fB--credit-status\fP=""
	Credit status.; one of: available, consumed, voided

.PP
\fB--currency\fP=""
	Currency as an ISO 4217 code.

.PP
\fB--external-customer-id\fP=""
	External customer id.

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
